   web

4.what happens when you cick "GET DATA"
when we click Get data option , powerbi shows different sources and when we select any source ,it connects to the selected data souce

5.How do you load data into powerbi / what are the data loading steps
  open powerbi desktop
  click Get Data
  select data source
  connect to data source
  finally select load or transfer

6.what is ETL?How do you perform ETL activities in powerbi
ETL means Extract,Transfer,Load
->Extract helps to get data from different sources like excel,csv files,sql server and oracle
->Transfer means it helps to make changes to data like changing datatypes,remove nulls and duplicates using power query 
->Load means after cleaning data , power query load data into powerbi
we extract getting data from various sources like excel,csv files and transfer the data to make changes by using power query editor and load into powerbi

7.what is the difference b/w Load and transfer
Load - It loads data directly,no need to modify
Transfer - It's uncleaned data,Need to make changes using power query editor





